  "details": "1. Create float or int type parameter in animator\n\n2. Create int type toggle control (Can be with any int parameter)\n\n3. Set write value for control\n\n4. Change to bool type control (matching parameter name in animator)\n\nToggle will set the animator parameter to the previously assigned int value rather than the boolean value as expected.\n\nFor example, setting the integer value for the control to 3, then switching to a boolean type control will now set the animator parameter to 3 upon enabling the toggle, and 0 upon disabling.",
